  <FLAVOURTEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[Kithkin somnomancers enjoy the peaceful dreams wafting from their victims.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[Les somnomanciens sangamis s'enivrent des émanations des rêves paisibles de leurs victimes.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[Los somnomantes kithkin disfrutan los pacíficos sueños que extraen de sus víctimas.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[Kithkin-Schlafmagier genießen die friedlichen Träume, die von ihren Opfern aufsteigen.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[I sonnomanti kithkin amano i sogni pacifici che si diffondono dalle loro vittime.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[キスキンの睡魔術師は、自分たちの獲物の穏やかな夢を楽しんでいる。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA[키스킨 수면술사들은 자신이 잠재운 이가 꾸는 평화로운 꿈을 즐긴다.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[Кискенские усыпители наслаждаются мирными сновидениями своих жертв.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[Os sonomânticos kithkin deleitam-se com os plácidos sonhos que emanam de suas vítimas.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[洁英入梦术士很喜欢被其催眠者散发的平静眠梦气氛。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[潔英入夢術士很喜歡被其催眠者散發的平靜眠夢氣氛。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
  </FLAVOURTEXT>
